= The end

[? if georgia_survives = 1 and bol_regime = 1 : Epilogue: Georgia survived the winter of 1921. A free Georgia, a Menshevik republic on the shore of the Black Sea, remains one of the unfinished possibilities of the revolution. ?]

*Thank you for playing Red October. It is a work in progress, and this is a game of alternate history.*

